# DRC-OVL-1: Default illegal overlap: poly in the parent over ndiff in a child; CAP (error_s, why 2); printrules.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load child
box 0 0 10 10
paint ndiff
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell child
box 4 -3 6 13
paint poly
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
writeall force
drc printrules rules.txt
